00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:14.490
But when this mighty book was opened

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:16.530
The powers were set free

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:20.690
Cardcaptors, a mystic adventure

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:23.630
Cardcaptors, a quest for all time

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:26.650
