00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:19.700
So what, did something happen to him?

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:22.880
He was supposed to make the first visit to the shrine with us,

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:25.660
but Tori said he was too exhausted to make it.

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:29.440
He said he would come over tomorrow for a visit.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.800
I really hope he's feeling better by then and can make it.

00:11:33.570 --> 00:11:35.970
Sakura's magical power is getting stronger,

00:11:36.310 --> 00:11:40.810
but she is still not strong enough to make Yue continue to exist at this point.

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:45.930
I can create my own magical powers, but Yue can only borrow his mother's.

00:11:46.090 --> 00:11:48.320
If this keeps up, Lillian...

00:11:48.790 --> 00:11:49.010
Hero!

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:55.500
Yeah, he's coming over tomorrow. That's nice.

00:12:04.796 --> 00:12:06.796
Is that a written fortune?

00:12:07.036 --> 00:12:09.036
That's a really strange fortune.

00:12:09.036 --> 00:12:10.036
Yeah, it is!

00:12:10.364 --> 00:12:12.364
I don't have a clue what it means.

00:12:12.476 --> 00:12:15.216
Okay, that fortune came from the teacher's shrine, right?

00:12:15.416 --> 00:12:18.396
Her magical powers could influence the fortunes.

00:12:19.676 --> 00:12:22.476
We'll just have to see what your first dream is

00:12:23.164 --> 00:12:25.784
Uh-huh.

00:12:26.428 --> 00:12:27.868
Okay, lights out!

00:12:28.860 --> 00:12:29.700
Okay.

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:31.440
Good night, Sakura.

00:12:31.920 --> 00:12:32.720
Good night, Kiro.

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:29.940
It all but a very straight

