Were you worried about me, Kiro?

00:16:33.290 --> 00:16:37.250
Uh, well, you know, I just was making sure you didn't have a scary nightmare.

00:16:39.530 --> 00:16:40.710
What is this thing?

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:46.800
Sakura?

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:48.860
