00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:16.340
wasn't any ordinary dream. What was it about? It was weird. First I was fighting, was everywhere,

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:21.730
and saw all kinds of different places. But when I got to the shrine, the sky suddenly

00:17:21.730 --> 00:17:29.970
grew dark. The sun and moon were darkened. And

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:32.640
Someone was on top of the shrine gate.

